  "decisions": "the worker records every sub-request (without world; probe path as length and end states) and result; Python runs its unchanged screen_candidate / plan_candidate against a replay client that serves them; a request the worker did not issue (or a recorded one not requested) raises NATIVE_FLOW_DIVERGED; no fallback",
